// ─── Common token types across languages ────────────────────────────────────
// Token type     | Example values         | Notes
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// KEYWORD        | if, let, return        | Language reserved words
// IDENTIFIER     | x, total, myVar        | User-defined names
// NUMBER         | 42, 3.14, 0xFF         | Integer & float literals
// STRING         | 'hello', "world"       | String literals
// OPERATOR       | +, -, *, ==, <=        | Arithmetic & comparison
// PUNCTUATION    | ; , . ( ) { } [ ]      | Structural delimiters
// COMMENT        | // ... /* ... */       | Usually discarded
// EOF            | (end sentinel)         | Signals end of input
